#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md:11
msgid ""
"本页由原 CSV 派生，不是新的状态权威、执行记录或软件资格。 原编号、顺序和全部原字段来自 {download}`原台账 "
"<../../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>`。 源文件：`docs/design/platform-"
"delivery-"
"completion.csv`；SHA-256：`256deef275171d3480ef2f6f18393c5bd97e422a085f2a17b143bb84c8855d6b`。"
msgstr ""
"This page derives from the original CSV; it is not a new status authority, "
"execution record or software qualification. Original IDs, order and every "
"original field come from the {download}`original ledger "
"<../../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>`. Source: "
"`docs/design/platform-delivery-completion.csv`; SHA-256: "
"`256deef275171d3480ef2f6f18393c5bd97e422a085f2a17b143bb84c8855d6b`."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md:15
msgid ""
"不同台账范围重叠，不相加数量或计算全项目完成率。实现状态与软件、 物理状态分别解释；`development_passed` 不表示当前文档 HEAD "
"已执行。 `qualification_record_authority` 要回到精确结果索引判断源码和范围。 绝对 "
"`/workspace`、`/dev/shm` 定位保留原字节，仅说明原执行主机位置； 可取得归档及 member 定位见 "
"[软件证据入口](../software-verification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Different ledgers overlap in scope; do not add their counts or calculate a "
"project-wide completion rate. Interpret implementation, software and "
"physical status separately. `development_passed` does not mean execution at "
"the current documentation HEAD. Consult the exact results index for the "
"source and scope of `qualification_record_authority`. Absolute `/workspace` "
"and `/dev/shm` locators retain their original bytes and only identify the "
"original execution host. See the [software-evidence entry](../software-"
"verification.md) for retrievable archives and member locations."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md:21
msgid "**原退出字段**只有原 CSV 中实际存在的字段；任务、资格前提和合同链接 也按原文保留，不能据此补造某次执行。"
msgstr ""
"**Original exit fields** are only fields actually present in the original "
"CSV. Tasks, qualification prerequisites and contract links also retain their"
" original wording; they cannot be used to invent an execution."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md:24
msgid "本表包含 78 条原记录，仅表示来源行数。"
msgstr ""
"This table contains 78 original records; this is only the source row count."

